{{DISPLAYTITLE: <span class="text-legendary";">Fisherman</span>}}
{{Protection}}{{MagicWords}}

{{Card Infobox|Cost=3|Rarity=Legendary|Type=Troop|Arena=Miner's Mine|ReleaseDate=5 August 2019}}
{{Quote|His Ranged Attack can pull enemies towards him, and pull himself to enemy buildings. He's also mastered the ancient art of 'Fish Slapping'.}}

The Fisherman is a {{Rarity|Legendary}} [[Cards|card]] that is unlocked from the [[Arenas|Miner's Mine (Arena 15)]] or a [[Chests|Legendary Chest]]. It spawns a single-target, ground-targeting, melee, ground [[:Category:Troop Cards|troop]] with moderate hitpoints and moderate damage. If there are ground units between 3.5 and 7 tiles of him, he will stop moving and begin charging a hook attack which takes 1.3 seconds to execute, and either pulls enemy troops towards him, or pulls himself towards [[:Category:Building Cards|buildings]], and slow their movement and attack speed by 35% for 1.5 seconds. The Fisherman takes an appearance as a man with a large nose, blue eyes, blonde eyebrows and beard, wearing a team-colored hat which covers his eyes and overalls with a team-colored patch on it and a star shell behind it, and carries a hook tied on a rope and a deep indigo fish. A Fisherman card costs 3 Elixir to deploy.

